  "notes": "Rebuilt after the original file (never committed to git, deployed outside version control) was lost. Each direction's target is defined by pushing one gene to a typographically meaningful extreme (e.g. italic = max skeletonShear), measured through this repo's own generatedLetterformVector-equivalent pipeline (paintLetterWord + shapeDescriptorOf + letterformMetrics, unmodified). The move for each direction is a genuine coordinate-ascent search over the five allowed genes (penWeight, widthAxis, xHeight, skeletonShear, skeletonExtend), maximizing cosine similarity against that measured target - not hand-assigned."
